  "label": "ABOUT THE JOURNAL",
  "headline": "Travel should feel like time well spent.",
  "body": "I’m Shaun. The Travel Taylor is where I keep the places, meals and journeys that are worth remembering — along with the honest bits that glossy travel writing sometimes edits out. I like beautiful hotels, thoughtful service, excellent food and a proper drink. I also like freedom: the kind that comes from planning the important things well, then leaving enough space for the unexpected."
